00:04:09.340 --> 00:04:15.900
questions that lab studies alone could not address quickly. One memorable detail is that the project

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:22.400
completed its core data set expansion in a matter of days instead of years. Listeners can watch for

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:28.100
