00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:33.780
Especially those using photo databases to map trait distributions across continents.

00:04:34.640 --> 00:04:39.720
From rapid data collection in the field to long-term climate pressures on breeding timing,

00:04:40.320 --> 00:04:46.700
