exposure assessments for populations still encountering legacy sources. Further sampling will clarify

00:06:30.080 --> 00:06:35.780
current risk levels. Legacy sources remain active in multiple environmental compartments.

00:06:36.560 --> 00:06:43.500
A study released this week attributed at least 2,700 deaths in England and Wales to May and June

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:49.640
