00:07:02.640 --> 00:07:09.360
to recorded fatalities. University of Liverpool and University of Strathclyde researchers demonstrated

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:16.240
a method to locate nanoscale defects that reduce LED efficiency. The approach reveals how defects

00:07:16.240 --> 00:07:22.200
