00:07:22.200 --> 00:07:28.660
and display applications. Next steps involve scaling the imaging for industrial use. The technique

00:07:28.660 --> 00:07:35.540
operates at the resolution needed to inspect individual crystal lattices. Researchers upgraded a

00:07:35.540 --> 00:07:40.500
classic reaction with visible light to assemble intricate structures in fewer steps.

00:07:41.300 --> 00:07:46.360
The approach reduces solvent use and intermediate isolations common in traditional roots.

00:07:47.180 --> 00:07:53.440
It targets molecules needed for drug discovery programs. Further optimization will test compatibility

00:07:53.440 --> 00:08:00.020
with diverse functional groups. The light driven route shortens synthetic sequences for several classes

00:08:00.020 --> 00:08:06.220
of complex scaffolds. From species level timing mismatches to preserving chemical records of

00:08:06.220 --> 00:08:13.760
early earth, lunar science now faces contamination risks from spacecraft exhaust. A new study models how

